1. **Imports** — added `Depends`, `Query` from fastapi; `Optional` from typing.
2. **`GET /tasks`** (filtering + pagination) — optional `status` (string), `priority` (int), `assigned_to` (string) query params filter the in-memory list; `page` (default 1) and `page_size` (default 20) slice the result. All filters are combinable.
